{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Big Winner Lucky  Pack DLC Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Soundtrack (OST): 2 vocal tracks + 16 instrumental tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music Player\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonus Item Pack:<br>\u2022 Vehicle: Rainbow E-Bike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Outfits: Tuxedo Set (Coat + Black Pants + Dress Shoes), Wedding Gown, Veil Hairstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Furniture: Exclusive Floor-to-Ceiling Window, Exclusive Lucky Doll</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Notes &amp; DLC Collection Guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b <i>This product does not include the base game. Players who already own Big Winner will receive the above rewards upon purchasing this pack.</i><br>\u203b Outfits and hairstyles require reaching T9 - 3 stars, then claim them from the DLC Agent at MORE. Rewarded furniture requires reaching T7 - 3 stars, then claim it from the DLC Agent at iHouse. The Rainbow e-bike requires reaching T6, then claim it from the DLC Agent at Bike Store.  <br>\u203b <i>After purchase, a [Music] button will appear on the top-left corner of the game's main interface, where you can directly listen to the curated game soundtrack.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b Restart the game after purchasing DLC for verification. Rewards are reclaimable in New Game+ runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Music Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798040/extras/79dda24d80f4c11ce3dccf9773aae85a.avif?t=1752835577\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lucky Item Pack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798040/extras/6216e1251ba92407851ee5a0104130a5.avif?t=1752835577\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2